0..76 Comment "// A theory\'s laws stated as the path types they are, `law name : type`: the"
77..150 Comment "// equations a model proves, where a rule is a rewrite the theory orients"
151..218 Comment "// . Reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity of a decision, the last"
219..293 Comment "// under two hypotheses, none of which a rule could state: symmetry has no"
294..373 Comment "// orientation and reflexivity\'s left side reads its variable twice. A model at"
374..447 Comment "// a type of its own proves each law by a definition at the law\'s path; a"
448..522 Comment "// model at a host primitive admits each, `law refl = ~admitted;`, and the"
523..600 Comment "// report\'s audit lists the admission in place of an obligation. A model that"
601..680 Comment "// leaves a law out has the checker discharge it: `Path.here` at the law\'s left"
681..746 Comment "// side, where its sides convert. A theory including a lawful one"
747..822 Comment "// restricts its models to the included theory\'s, the laws carried by name."
823..896 Comment "// The refusals are beside `../../pathological/modules/model-laws.gandr`."
897..899 Comment "//"
900..915 Comment "// - see: #2356"
916..931 Comment "// - see: #4112"
